{"u": "10762148295", "name": "[UPD] Something is Wrong With My Dog...", "place": "133409496563091", "created": "2026-08-26", "updated": "2026-10-30T23:56:53.044Z", "genre": "Adventure", "subgenre": "Story", "desc": "🐺 You found a stray wolf at the edge of the woods. You named him Jerry.\nEvery morning, he leaves something dead beside your bed. 🦴\n\nSomeone uploaded a strange build of the game, then deleted it a day later. You installed it anyway. The world was already there... and so was Bob.\n\n🌲 FEATURES\n🐾 Tame Jerry with bones and keep him close\n🛏️ Build a camp and survive until morning\n🗺️ Follow Bob's map to his cabin, his grave and his log\n🔦 Explore a huge blocky world of caves, forests and marshes\n👥 Play solo or with up to 8 players\n💀 10 endings to uncover\n⛏️ Survival Mode: the same world, no story\n🎨 Capes for you, collars for Jerry\n\nCan you figure out what's wrong with Jerry before it's too late?\n\n🎮 CONTROLS\nWASD - Move | E - Inventory | M - Map\nLeft Click - Break / Attack | Right Click - Place / Use\n\n👍 Like and favourite for updates!\n⚠️ Contains jumpscares and blood. Play with the lights on.\n\nInspired by LookOut2DD's \"Something Is Wrong With My Dog...\"", "desc_hash": "65aeff14ee72", "max_players": 20, "vip": false, "price": null, "avatar": "MorphToR15", "visits": 9814769, "favorites": 98113, "creator": {"id": 34797797, "name": "• DELTA •", "type": "Group", "verified": false}, "daily": {"2026-10-21": {"updated": "2026-10-21T15:54:25.602Z", "visits": 1109904, "fav": 5686, "up": 679, "down": 245}, "2026-10-22": {"updated": "2026-10-22T17:29:24.625Z", "visits": 2066827, "fav": 10972, "up": 1285, "down": 426}, "2026-10-23": {"updated": "2026-10-23T16:08:26.979Z", "visits": 2908628, "fav": 15845, "up": 1957, "down": 640}, "2026-10-24": {"updated": "2026-10-24T06:18:20.95Z", "visits": 4507037, "fav": 23989, "up": 3031, "down": 946}, "2026-10-25": {"updated": "2026-10-24T06:18:20.95Z", "visits": 6022521, "fav": 32992, "up": 4219, "down": 1283}, 